OL,3,ACorridor care not the standard we want
OL,4,Ato see in NHS, Health Secetary Yvette
OL,5,ACooper tells Laura Kuenssberg
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper says
OL,8,Fpatients being treated in hospital
OL,9,Fcorridors is "not the standard of care
OL,10,Fwe want to see" in the NHS - watch live
OL,11,Fabove
OL,13,FSpeaking on Sunday with Laura
OL,14,FKuenssberg, Cooper says "nobody should
OL,15,Fbe being treated in corridors" and
OL,16,Funveils 14 urgent treatment centres to
OL,17,Ftackle the issue
OL,19,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski will
OL,20,Falso face questions from Kuenssberg
OL,21,Fthis morning
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
